# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

outIntMap is project
outIntMap purpose "An audit program just outside the stage0 subset, which refined accepts; stage0 refuses it"
outIntMap target console
outIntMap version "0.1.0"
outIntMap language refined 1
outIntMap standardLibrary 1
outIntMap allows write console.stdout none
outIntMap requires none
outIntMap includesModule outIntMap
outIntMap entry outIntMap.main
